{{define "content"}}<main class="final-support">
<section class="final-section"><div class="final-label">Support</div><div class="final-content">
<h1>Support the lab.</h1><p class="final-lead">Explore the public experiments, files and write-ups for free. Supporting gives you early access to new artifacts and higher hosted limits, including additional saved workspaces and model allowance, and helps us keep the lab running.</p>
<ol class="support-principles"><li>We prototype and explore. We don’t build products.</li><li>We work in public, unfinished work included.</li><li>We follow curiosity, not a roadmap.</li><li>We stay true to how we actually like to work.</li><li>Everything we make stays free and open, for everyone.</li></ol>
<div class="support-options">
{{if .Supporter}}<p>Thank you for supporting the lab.</p><a class="u" href="/account">Manage subscription →</a>{{else}}
<div class="support-tiers" data-support-tiers>
<div class="support-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Support" hidden><button type="button" role="tab" id="support-tab-individual" aria-controls="support-panel-individual" aria-selected="true" data-tier="">{{$.Copy.Text "support.tab.individual"}}</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="support-tab-enterprise" aria-controls="support-panel-enterprise" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-tier="enterprise">{{$.Copy.Text "support.tab.enterprise"}}</button></div>
<div class="support-panel" role="tabpanel" id="support-panel-individual" aria-labelledby="support-tab-individual">
<form class="support-monthly" data-support-monthly>
<label class="final-label" for="support-amount">Every month</label>
<div class="support-amount-controls"><button type="button" data-amount-step="-1" aria-label="Decrease monthly support">−</button><div class="support-amount-value"><input id="support-amount" name="amount" type="number" min="1" max="9999" step="1" value="42" inputmode="numeric" aria-label="Monthly support in US dollars" required><span>USD</span></div><button type="button" data-amount-step="1" aria-label="Increase monthly support">+</button></div>
<p class="support-amount-help" id="support-amount-help">We suggest 42 USD. Choose any amount that feels right, and cancel any time.</p>
<button class="site-button site-support" type="submit">Support monthly →</button>
</form></div>
<div class="support-panel" role="tabpanel" id="support-panel-enterprise" aria-labelledby="support-tab-enterprise">
<form class="support-monthly" data-support-enterprise>
<label class="final-label" for="support-enterprise-amount">{{$.Copy.Text "support.enterprise.label"}}</label>
<div class="support-amount-controls"><button type="button" class="support-shift" data-shift="right" title="Halve" aria-label="Halve the monthly amount">&gt;&gt;1</button><div class="support-amount-value"><output id="support-enterprise-amount" name="amount" aria-live="polite">256</output><span>USD</span></div><button type="button" class="support-shift" data-shift="left" title="Double" aria-label="Double the monthly amount">&lt;&lt;1</button></div>
<p class="support-amount-help">{{$.Copy.Text "support.enterprise.help"}}</p>
<button class="site-button site-support" type="submit">{{$.Copy.Text "support.enterprise.button"}}</button>
</form></div>
</div>{{end}}
</div>
<section class="support-year"><p class="final-label">Or fund a whole year</p><h2>999,999.99 USD</h2><p>This one is a bet. A single payment covers a year of basic income for both of us, so the lab can be all we do. We’re serious about working this way. If you want to fund it, we’re ready.</p><form data-support-year><button class="tlink u" type="submit">Fund a year →</button></form></section>
</div></section>
<section class="final-section support-contact"><div class="final-label">Contact</div><div class="final-content"><p>{{with $.Contact}}Write to us any time at <a class="u" href="mailto:{{.}}">{{.}}</a>. {{end}}To stay independent, we don’t run ads, take paid partnerships or accept client work. Offers of compute, and things you think we should play with, are always welcome.</p></div></section>
</main>{{end}}
